          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Born and raised in Kashmir, our team knows the hidden viewpoints, the best seasonal timings, and authentic local artisans.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border card-hover">
          <div class="icon-container-light mb-4 w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-softsky text-brand-blue">
            <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Dedicated Travel Assistance</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Direct 24/7 on-trip assistance from your dedicated Kashmir coordinator to ensure peace of mind throughout your stay.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 6 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border card-hover">
          <div class="icon-container-light mb-4 w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-softsky text-brand-blue">
            <i data-lucide="car" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Comfortable Arrangements</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
